ion}\\vdash\n\\delta_0(q,a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_E\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in\\operatorname{EClos}_E(\\{q\\})}\\delta(p,a)\\right),\\qquad F_0\\coloneqq\\{q\\in Q:\\operatorname{EClos}_E(\\{q\\})\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\delta_0(q,a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_E\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in\\operatorname{EClos}_E(\\{q\\})}\\delta(p,a)\\right),\\qquad F_0\\coloneqq\\{q\\in Q:\\operatorname{EClos}_E(\\{q\\})\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoEps}(E)\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta_0,q_0,F_0),\\qquad\\operatorname{NoEps}(E)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoEps}(E)\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta_0,q_0,F_0),\\qquad\\operatorname{NoEps}(E)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先闭包、读一个字符、再闭包；终态修正使空词的接受也正确。只去掉转移标签中的空词，不改变输入字母表。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-reachability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"b4ab199feb1a8020","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":